{"id":"como","lemma":"como","pos":"conj","rank":32,"glosses":["as (introducing a basis of comparison or equality)","as, since (being that)","how (in which way)"],"ipa":"/komo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Julie_Samothrace-como.wav/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Julie_Samothrace-como.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Hazlo como te digo.","en":"Do as I tell you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65895","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"I mean"}]},{"text":"¿Eso iba como broma?","en":"Was that intended as a joke?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77646","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null,{"g":"joke"}]},{"text":"Tomaré eso como un sí.","en":"I'll take that as a yes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518077","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"yes"}]},{"text":"Tienes que hacer como digo.","en":"You have to do as I say.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515013","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do"},null,{"g":"I mean"}]},{"text":"Es tan alto como mi padre.","en":"He is as tall as my father.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/50389","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"so, as"},{"g":"tall"},null,{"g":"my"},{"g":"father, parent"}]}]}